    ellmer (>= 0.5.0),
    htmltools,
    jsonlite,
    keyring (>= 1.3.0),
    knitr,
    later,
    remotes,
    rstudioapi,
    shiny (>= 1.14.0)
URL: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant
